WEBVTT

00:00:03.172 --> 00:00:08.306
Some stores need their own questions at checkout, such as a gift message.

00:00:08.306 --> 00:00:14.349
With the Checkout details feature on, open Design, Content Types, and Checkout details.

00:00:14.349 --> 00:00:16.363
It starts with no fields.

00:00:16.363 --> 00:00:17.792
Click Add Field.

00:00:18.245 --> 00:00:23.215
Give the field a name, such as Gift message, choose Text Field, and save.

00:00:23.668 --> 00:00:27.573
Click Save and Configure, and the field's options open.

00:00:27.573 --> 00:00:30.518
Tick Required if buyers must fill it in.

00:00:30.518 --> 00:00:34.744
You can add a placeholder, a default value and a length too.

00:00:34.744 --> 00:00:35.768
Then save.

